  "kind": "result-note",
  "original_status": "unresolved",
  "scope": "For the unchanged formal determinant R_k defined in evidence/flag-coefficient-hypothesis.md and fully restated in evidence/research-pass3.md, put K=k(k+1)/2 and lambda_k=(product_{r=1}^k r!)/(product_{l=1}^k l^l)>0. For every integer k>=5, [a^(K-1) n^0 z_1^5 z_6...z_k]R_k = -lambda_k*(125k^4-9555k^3+17736k^2-346478k+858264)/20736, where the final z product is empty for k=5. This coefficient is negative for every integer k>=76. Also [a^252 n^0 z_1^9 z_10...z_22]R_22 = -lambda_22*4429926944297146258237/14051921264640000000 < 0. For every k>=1, [a^(K-1) n^0 z_1...z_k]R_k = lambda_k*k(k+1)(2k+1)/6 > 0. These statements refute only the project-generated all-k coefficient-nonnegativity hypothesis in the specified slack variables, and do not disprove or prove total nonnegativity of H_d.",
